### Get current establishment settings
GET {{baseUrl}}/establishments/current
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.access_token}}
Accept: application/json

### Change current establishment name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/establishments/current/name
Authorization: Bearer {{signIn.response.body.$.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Scoops Centro"
}
